<title>USA: Memorial Center, Ga., deal yields 5.75 pct in 2021.</title>
<headline>Memorial Center, Ga., deal yields 5.75 pct in 2021.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shattuck Hammond Partners said Wednesday it tentatively priced $156.5 million Chatham County Hospital Authority, Ga., bonds for Memorial Medical Center at a top yield of 5.75 percent in 2021.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
